    <item>
      <title>跨越“Sim-to-Real”鸿沟：工业物理AI如何重塑精密制造的工程范式</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/sim-to-realai-20260721124003497-1/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 12:40:03 +0800</pubDate>
